---
# CI gate. The only global skip is tristate house style; deliberate
# site-specific exceptions use inline `# noqa` so future violations fail.
# The tree already passes the production profile, so require it rather than
# the looser basic default.
profile: production
skip_list:
  # Tristate groups compare against true/false explicitly: "ignore" is a
  # truthy string, so truthiness alone cannot express the three values.
  - literal-compare
